Location in this repository
---------------------------

The vendored files are under ZInQKernel/Contrib/TauCeti/ (Lean module prefix
ZInQKernel.Contrib.TauCeti.). A Tau Ceti module TauCeti.A.B is vendored as
ZInQKernel/Contrib/TauCeti/A/B.lean. Every vendored file keeps Tau Ceti's copyright
header and carries, directly after it, a provenance line

  -- Vendored from Tau Ceti (https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti, commit <sha>, module <module>), Apache-2.0.

naming the source commit and module. Declaration names and namespaces are unchanged.
The mechanical changes made to every vendored file are this provenance line and the
rewriting of each `import TauCeti.X` to `import ZInQKernel.Contrib.TauCeti.X`.
Files under Backport/ (task kw-new) hold declarations taken from the commit-97a5b235
version of a Tau Ceti module whose commit-5a01f5fe version is vendored; they keep
Tau Ceti's copyright header and carry a line "-- Backported from Tau Ceti (...)"
naming the source commit and module.

Files under Backport/ from task t40-tate carry, instead of the provenance line, the
lines "-- Backported from Tau Ceti (https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti, commit
4d91513e4d30, module <module>), Apache-2.0: ..." naming the source module, and every
one of them carries a "-- Modified for the Z-in-Q kernel: ..." line: all have their
imports rewritten (to ZInQKernel.Contrib.TauCeti.X for vendored modules and to
ZInQKernel.Contrib.TauCeti.Backport.X for backported ones), the five partial files
have the declarations already present in the vendored module removed, and six files
have further changes for the pinned Mathlib, named in their note line:
Backport/Analysis/Normed/Field/ZPowers.lean, Backport/Analysis/Normed/Group/Ultra.lean,
Backport/Algebra/Polynomial/Derivative.lean,
Backport/Topology/Algebra/InfiniteSum/IntegralCoefficients.lean,
Backport/Analysis/Normed/Module/InfiniteSum.lean and
Backport/AlgebraicGeometry/EllipticCurve/TateCurve/Injectivity.lean. Declaration
names and namespaces are unchanged, so a Backport/ file of task t40-tate must not be
imported together with a commit-5a01f5fe copy of the same module vendored at the
non-Backport path (none is vendored at the time of writing, except the five modules
completed by the partial files).

